ing fall or the loss of caste;\n n. such a\ncrime.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}, {"id": "pAtanIya", "headword": "पातनीय", "headword_slp1": "pAtanIya", "fold": "pataniya", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "capeller-sanskrit-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "पातनीय a. to be caused to fall or thrown.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "patant": [{"id": "patant", "headword": "पतन्त्", "headword_slp1": "patant", "fold": "patant", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "capeller-sanskrit-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "पतन्त् a. flying. m. a bird.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["पतत्"], "synonyms_slp1": ["patat"]}], "patay": [{"id": "patay", "headword": "पतय्", "headword_slp1": "patay", "fold": "patay", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "capeller-sanskrit-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "पतय् पत॑यति fly, hasten, M. drive away or fell.\n—अच्छ & आ A. fly to (acc.). वि A. open, go or fly asunder.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "patayalu": [{"id": "patayAlu", "headword": "पतयालु", "headword_slp1": "patayAlu", "fold": "patayalu", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "capeller-sanskrit-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "पतयालु॑ a. flying.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["पतयालुः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["patayAluH"]}], "patayisRu": [{"id": "patayizRu", "headword": "पतयिष्णु", "headword_slp1": "patayizRu", "fold": "patayisRu", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "capeller-sanskrit-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "पत˚यिष्णु॑ a. flying.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "patayisRuka": [{"id": "patayizRuka", "headword": "पतयिष्णुक", "headword_slp1": "patayizRuka", "fold": "patayisRuka", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "capeller-sanskrit-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "पत˚यिष्णुक॑ a. flying.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "patara": [{"id": "patara", "headword": "पतर", "headword_slp1": "patara", "fold": "patara", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "capeller-sanskrit-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "पतर॑ a. flying, fugitive.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "pataru": [{"id": "pat